{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳展鵬今日（2日）出席無綫節目，以「明星乒乓球隊」隊長的身份帶領藝人接受乒乓球特訓，終極目標是迎戰香港隊名將。</p><p>身為前香港乒乓球隊成員的展鵬在現場大晒球技，就算用手機打球亦難不到他，他說：「節目最重要係宣揚乒乓球。</p><p>（節目為你而設？</p><p>）我真係</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.503341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:10:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.408084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.408084+00:00","content_hash":"ef863802df0878cc2132ce0b5f30cb791fd39be841f4220cb5ff9f80ebe5550d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}